@branchId = {{ '00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001' }}
@productId = {{ '9971dc5f-5d21-4d32-8146-3766515d549b' }}

### Restock product at a branch
POST {{host}}/dashboard/inventories/adjust
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "branchId": "{{branchId}}",
  "quantity": 20,
  "type": "RESTOCK",
  "note": "Opening stock"
}

### Adjust stock down (spoilage / recount)
POST {{host}}/dashboard/inventories/adjust
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "branchId": "{{branchId}}",
  "quantity": 2,
  "type": "ADJUST",
  "direction": "DEBIT",
  "note": "Spoilage"
}

### List inventory for a branch
GET {{host}}/dashboard/inventories?branchId={{branchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List inventory for a product
GET {{host}}/dashboard/inventories?productId={{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one inventory row
GET {{host}}/dashboard/inventories/{{inventoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List ledger rows
GET {{host}}/dashboard/inventories/transactions?branchId={{branchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one ledger row
GET {{host}}/dashboard/inventories/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
